# Documentation *about* the project — plans, roadmaps, decision logs, working
# notes — stays local. Documentation *of* the product (README, CHANGELOGs,
# changesets) is committed. `pnpm check:docs` enforces the split in CI, since
# ignoring a file does not stop `git add -f`.
docs/
notes/
TODO.md
NOTES.md
*.notes.md
*.plan.md

